      "content": "This clause allows you to use any non-tangible residual information, like the specific ways to optimize SQL queries you learned, for any other clients, as long as you don't disclose the original Financial Information. So yes, you can use those optimization patterns for your other clients, as long as you're not sharing the confidential details from the original client's data. Hope that clears things up!",
